# Cloudflare Pages headers.
#
# COOP + COEP turn on SharedArrayBuffer, which lets the OxiPNG and AVIF encoders
# use their multi-threaded builds instead of falling back to a single core.
# Safe here because Pare loads nothing cross-origin - there is no server, no CDN
# script and no third-party asset to be blocked.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
